{"id": "q0078", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3940854717, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Tim makes a special honey and jam mix.  To make 1 jar of the mixture it takes 2 pounds of passion fruit and 1.5 pounds of jackfruit.  It also takes 2 pounds of special honey.  The passion fruit costs $6 per pound, the jackfruit is $8 per pound, and the honey is $10 per pound.  He sells each jar for $50.  How much profit does he make selling 10 jars?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0078.wav", "input_sha256": "5e06c8d44142b8a572c0e0aa75dbca4641e14c61dab2c0457be5cd300311d100", "input_samples": 437600, "input_s": 27.35, "n_real_chunks": 28, "score": 0.3595, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Let's calculate Tim' s profit for selling 1 0 jars of his honey and jam mix. First, we'll find the cost to make one jar, then multiply by 10, and subtract that from the total revenue from selling 10 jar s.For one jar:Passion fruit costs $6 per pound, and he uses 2 pounds, so that' s 6 times 2 equal s $12. Jack fruit is $8 per pound, using 1.5 pounds, so that's 8 times 1.5 equal s $1 2.The honey is $1 0 per pound, and he needs 2 pounds, so that's 1 0 times 2 equal s $20. Now, adding those together for the cost of one jar: 1 2 plus 1 2 plus 2 0 equals $4 4.So, each jar costs him $4 4 to make. For 10 jars, the total cost is 44 times 10 equal s $4 40.He sell s each jar for $50, so for 10 jar s, the total revenue is 5 0 times 10 equal s $50 0.Finally, to find the profit,", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 27, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 19228, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 563829, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0078_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "bc38b21710d4436c4e7b53e3e6e4073c2cd53739c605742a28b4fd2872673e17", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.123, 1.224, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.12, 2.216, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.122, 3.221, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.123, 4.224, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.125, 5.226, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.126, 6.232, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.13, 7.235, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.124, 8.225, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.125, 9.226, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.126, 10.228, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.124, 11.224, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.129, 12.23, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.123, 13.222, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.127, 14.228, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.121, 15.219, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.129, 16.23, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.125, 17.226, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.128, 18.228, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.129, 19.229, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.126, 20.229, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.128, 21.229, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.127, 22.226, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.132, 23.237, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.133, 24.236, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.14, 25.247, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.128, 26.23, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.131, 27.233, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 27.35, 27.481, 28.486, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.35, 28.615, 29.775, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.35, 29.901, 30.947, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.35, 31.076, 32.344, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.35, 32.47, 33.646, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.35, 33.778, 34.953, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.35, 35.083, 36.347, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.35, 36.474, 37.673, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.35, 37.8, 39.058, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.35, 39.188, 40.315, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.35, 40.445, 41.6, 0, 