{"id": "q0149", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3071058655, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "If we write $\\sqrt{2}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} + \\sqrt{3} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ in the form $\\dfrac{a\\sqrt{2} + b\\sqrt{3}}{c}$ such that $a$, $b$, and $c$ are positive integers and $c$ is as small as possible, then what is $a+b+c$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0149.wav", "input_sha256": "1aba5f1aa218ea4829a3402ef44d24088c12e578440003f61eac5b024f65f75e", "input_samples": 267400, "input_s": 16.712, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.9183, "act": 0.9976, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "\\[ \\sqrt2+\\frac1{\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt3+\\frac1{\\sqrt3} \\] Rationalize the reciprocal terms: \\[ \\frac1{\\sqrt2}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2},\\qquad \\frac1{\\sqrt3}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3} \\] So, \\[ \\sqrt2+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\sqrt3+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3} = \\frac{3\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{3} \\] Common denominator \\(6\\): \\[ = \\frac{9\\sqrt2+8\\sqrt3}{6} \\] Thus \\(a=9,\\ b=8,\\ c=6\\), so \\[ a+b+c=9+8+6=23 \\] Answer: 23", "expert_answer": "\\[\n\\sqrt2+\\frac1{\\sqrt2}+\\sqrt3+\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\n\\]\n\nRationalize the reciprocal terms:\n\n\\[\n\\frac1{\\sqrt2}=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2},\\qquad \\frac1{\\sqrt3}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}\n\\]\n\nSo,\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt2+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\sqrt3+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}\n= \\frac{3\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{3}\n\\]\n\nCommon denominator \\(6\\):\n\n\\[\n= \\frac{9\\sqrt2+8\\sqrt3}{6}\n\\]\n\nThus \\(a=9,\\ b=8,\\ c=6\\), so\n\n\\[\na+b+c=9+8+6=23\n\\]\n\n**Answer: 23**", "transcript": "If we write a squirt 2 plus frac 1 squirt 2 plus squirt 3 plus frac 1 squirt in the form d frac d frac a squirt 2 plus b 3 c dollar such that positive integers and c dollar is as small as possible, then what is a as b plus c?\n", "asr_s": 1.21, "expert_s": 10.94, "expert_input_samples": 240000, "expert_input_s": 15.0, "expert_input_sha256": "91a8f0bd071bda9f8676195ec17c1d4ba2cca1a508776a7a9572056ffe685391", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.138, "relay_synth_ms": 276040, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 2, "feed_lag_max_ms": 2894, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 4390, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0149_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "1a76cf4419236dfa3c51220124ae7978097d2e7832ee4830d74388b7bea8fd62", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 319.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0149_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "824811571f14a3f4ae39f59afe08431600e18fea389ca9c7c786c838e628492f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0149_balanced_stall.wav", "sha256": "1a8565edbe3414676d7430fc8c46642744f20de104f9b5d9883edfa4fb007f25", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 3.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.125, 1.226, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.126, 2.227, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.126, 3.228, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.127, 4.23, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.127, 5.236, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.128, 6.236, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.126, 7.228, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.133, 8.24, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.125, 9.229, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.134, 10.244, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.135, 11.244, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.135, 12.245, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.13, 13.237, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.132, 14.241, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.135, 16.035, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 17.625, 19.606, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 1, 16.712, 19.742, 21.052, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 16.712, "last_real_feed_done": 19.742, "onset": 16.035, "gate_read_done": 16.036, "fire": 16.036, "candidate_first_pcm": 16.035, "