{"id": "q0501", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3669116725, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "公司可以引入哪些新流程来减少碳足迹？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0501.wav", "input_sha256": "1883cae31df935234da82dd60d4701d237119c158ea51d8c2eb06b60452b44e0", "input_samples": 62400, "input_s": 3.9, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.46, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Well, there are a few things that you can do. You could reduce the amount of time that people spend traveling to work by having more remote work options. You could also encourage your employees to carpool or use public transportation. And if possible, you could even consider offering incentives for those who choose to walk or bike to work.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 19, "feed_lag_max_ms": 5287, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 49571, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0501_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "700409b25267332c3ae729a4d1def7d8c80eeb92f18b067762f35edfefcb26e5", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 18.56}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.13, 1.239, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.128, 2.229, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.124, 3.227, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.9, 4.028, 4.139, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.9, 5.025, 5.989, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.9, 6.113, 7.439, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.9, 7.559, 8.641, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.9, 8.764, 10.058, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.9, 10.185, 11.321, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.9, 11.448, 12.639, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.9, 12.768, 14.007, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.9, 14.133, 15.181, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.9, 15.308, 16.5, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.9, 16.625, 17.81, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.9, 17.937, 19.197, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.9, 19.328, 20.375, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.9, 20.505, 21.663, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.9, 21.796, 23.0, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.9, 23.132, 24.239, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.9, 24.368, 25.577, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.9, 25.709, 26.95, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.9, 27.084, 28.187, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.9, 28.321, 28.984, 0, 13440, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.9, "last_real_feed_done": 4.028, "onset": 5.989, "gate_read_done": 5.989, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 5.989, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 5.989, "first_answer_pcm": 5.989, "session_end": 28.984}, "ttfa_answer_s": 2.089, "ttfa_any_s": 2.089}
{"id": "q0524", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2565787960, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "分压电路的原理是什么？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0524.wav", "input_sha256": "9041d8d0d09801aedb3910612edd66003b9535800d8e50ece31e0dc01f31e2d5", "input_samples": 27800, "input_s": 1.738, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.1727, "act": 0.9945, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "分压电路的原理就是利用电阻器在串联电路中按比例分配电压。当多个电阻串联时，电流是相同的，但每个电阻会根据其阻值大小分担一部分电源的总电压。根据欧姆定律和基尔霍夫电压定律，各电阻两端的电压与它的阻值成正比。所以通过选择合适的电阻组合，可以得到特定的输出电压。这种电路常用于稳压、信号调节或为敏感元件提供适合的工作电压。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 41, "feed_lag_max_ms": 10919, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 229642, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0524_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "2895c0e5555b7d9f02b5142541db6238869c70cb3a5319f7f98286381ca1b7a3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 40.56}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.123, 1.223, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.738, 1.866, 1.968, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.737, 2.861, 2.964, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.737, 3.865, 3.97, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.737, 4.862, 6.093, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.737, 6.225, 7.356, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.737, 7.481, 8.702, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.737, 8.829, 9.931, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.738, 10.058, 11.194, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.738, 11.322, 12.404, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.738, 12.531, 13.723, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.738, 13.856, 14.986, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.738, 15.118, 16.325, 0, 2