{"id": "q0549", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2953120259, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "创建一个正则表达式，匹配一个有效的英国电话号码。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0549.wav", "input_sha256": "91590f6e98fb9e0c6c4243ea6eb8db9deb1297fee4be423fa9288e87135c0106", "input_samples": 71800, "input_s": 4.487, "n_real_chunks": 5, "score": 0.5825, "act": 0.9998, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "创建一个正则表达式来匹配有效英国电话号码时，我们需要考虑英国常见的格式。通常它们以零开头，后面是一个区号和若干数字。比如零一二三四五六七八九这样的形式。还有带空格或连字符的变体，比如零一二三四五六七八九。因此，我们可以写一个正则表达式来匹配这些情况。首先，从零开始，然后允许有或没有空格或连字符，接着跟上一些数字。具体来说，可以这样写：零后面跟一个或多个数字，中间可以有连字符或空格。简单起见，可以用零，然后是括号里的区号加号码部分。所以完整的正则表达式大概是这样：零，再", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 15803, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 465228, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0549_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "eafab2e326e161946030934a4bd6842dad7ec100460281c2ce84e6e45e551511", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 59.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.127, 1.23, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.121, 2.218, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.126, 3.229, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.127, 4.232, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 4.487, 4.616, 4.993, 0, 0, 0], [5, 0, 5.487, 5.616, 6.983, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.487, 7.107, 8.27, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.487, 8.396, 9.541, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.488, 9.666, 10.863, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.488, 10.989, 12.079, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.488, 12.207, 13.414, 0, 24000, 0], [11